 "questionType": "단답형",
 "content": "다음 식을 계산하시오.\n⑴ $21b^{7}\\div 7b^{2}$\n⑵ $8x^{9}\\div \\frac{1}{7}x^{8}$\n⑶ $-a^{8}b\\div 9a^{2}b^{7}$\n⑷ $(a^{2}b)^{3}\\div \\left(-\\frac{2b^{2}}{a}\\right)^{3}$",
 "choices": [],
 "answer": "⑴ $3b^{5}$ ⑵ $56x$ ⑶ $-\\frac{a^{6}}{9b^{6}}$ ⑷ $-\\frac{a^{9}}{8b^{3}}$",
 "solution": "⑴ $21b^{7}\\div 7b^{2}=\\frac{21b^{7}}{7b^{2}}=3b^{5}$\n⑵ $8x^{9}\\div \\frac{1}{7}x^{8}=8x^{9}\\times \\frac{7}{x^{8}}=56x$\n⑶ $-a^{8}b\\div 9a^{2}b^{7}=\\frac{-a^{8}b}{9a^{2}b^{7}}=-\\frac{a^{6}}{9b^{6}}$\n⑷ $(a^{2}b)^{3}=a^{6}b^{3}$, $\\left(-\\frac{2b^{2}}{a}\\right)^{3}=-\\frac{8b^{6}}{a^{3}}$ 이므로\n$a^{6}b^{3}\\div \\left(-\\frac{8b^{6}}{a^{3}}\\right)=a^{6}b^{3}\\times \\left(-\\frac{a^{3}}{8b^{6}}\\right)=-\\frac{a^{9}}{8b^{3}}$\n따라서 ⑴ $3b^{5}$ ⑵ $56x$ ⑶ $-\\frac{a^{6}}{9b^{6}}$ ⑷ $-\\frac{a^{9}}{8b^{3}}$",
 "score": null,
